&lt;p&gt;Rubrik&#39;s Product Line Sales organisation drives focused growth across Rubrik&#39;s specialised workloads, including our SaaS data protection and security portfolio (Microsoft 365, Google Workspace, Salesforce and other critical SaaS applications). This team partners closely with core Account Executives, Sales Engineers and Customer Success to bring deep product and technical expertise into every SaaS opportunity, from first conversation through technical validation to close.&lt;/p&gt;
